            "sid": "ISA 52:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwondũ wa ũu yu, nĩĩka ata vaa, easya ũu Yeova, nũndũ andũ makwa matwaĩtwe mana? Ala mamasumbĩkaa maneenaa na wasya mũnene, easya ũu Yeova, na syĩtwa yakwa nĩyĩumangawa mũthenya mũima ĩndĩ yonthe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
